<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0114/e_0005> <http://digistrucmed.org/entityType> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-type/POPULATION> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0114/tu_0001> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Central to palliative care approaches are communication and patient-caregiver engagement techniques.16" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-type/RATIONALE> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/EntityType> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0114/tu_0006> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Care of the patient with heart failure should extend to their loved ones, including beyond their death, to offer support to families and help them cope with loss." .
