<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0114/na_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasParameterEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_66b005a6484e5a6e96e40015102d69efc8bc0d0cc9a2a807f86d748d49b3068d_n0114/e_0013> .
